                                "sense_id": "607af889-66f0-3dbe-8ce2-281f592161c6",
                                "text": "On these plains, too, you will find the bushy oleander, many varieties of Jerusalem thorn and African rose, the bright scarlet of the cordium, bowers of jessamine, vines of grenadilla, and the silver and silky leaves of the portlandia."
                            }
