                                "sense_id": "e7fb024e-b944-3c5b-846f-44a918d90879",
                                "text": "Here and there we found a European farm, marked in the distance by the waving tops of the gum-trees, with the low wooden house festooned by the brilliant mauve blossoms of the climbing bougainvillea, and the garden enclosed by hedges of grenadilla, whose fruit is much eaten in South Africa."
